{
    "title": "Smart Messages",
    "description": "Smart Messages is the Best <b>SMS, MMS & RCS (Chat)</b> replacement texting app for your phone, with the greatest advanced and rich chat features for a gorgeous and fast texting experience with your friends. And the best part? <u>It\u2019s all completely free</u>!\r\n\r\n<b>Rich Communication Features</b>\r\nSmart Messages packs a modern Delivery and Read Receipt feature for SMS/MMS that works just like in popular instant messaging apps but without creating an account. It also has a fast and accurate Typing Indicator that shows you when your friends are texting you.\r\n\r\n<i>Note: The delivery receipts work out of the box, however the read receipts and typing indicator require Internet access and that your contacts use Smart Messages too. Rich Communication Features are compatible with every phone number and all mobile carriers.</i>\r\n\r\nSmart Messages is the BEST alternative to your stock SMS, MMS and RCS (chat) texting app, and the 1st messaging app with a predictive AI engine that anticipates what you want so you don\u2019t have to search.\r\n\r\nSee, not all texting apps are the same. If you are looking for the best SMS app 2023 look no further. With Smart Messages you get a messenger with first-class user experience, saving you time and making your life easier.\r\n\r\nSmart Messages has a great user interface based on the latest Material Design principles and offers the most complete set of features that you will love: read receipts and typing indicator (RCS features are only available to Smart Messages users), group chat, fast replies, emoji predictions based on intelligent emotion recognition in your text messages, easy sharing of videos, images, your geolocation\u2026 Texting with friends and family will never be the same!\r\n\r\nSmart Messages is 100% FREE FOREVER (NO subscription, NO paid features), does not track you, and protects your privacy as well as your phone data!\r\n\r\nDownload now the best SMS app for Android and start a magical journey!\r\n\r\n<b>Spam Blocker</b>\r\nMark any conversation as spam, and all similar messages will automagically go to spam next time you receive them.\r\n\r\n<b>Group Chat</b>\r\nSend and receive messages from multiple recipients, all in the same place. Please be aware that your carrier may limit this feature.\r\n\r\n<b>Dual SIM</b>\r\nSwitch easily between two phone numbers.\r\n\r\n<b>Smart Notifications</b>\r\nAnswer directly from notifications with a full-featured experience.\r\n\r\n<b>Fast Reply</b>\r\nRespond to messages even faster with smart suggestions.\r\n\r\n<b>Magic Cards</b>\r\nSmart Messages uses Artificial Intelligence (AI) to show you relevant actions when you need them, like a \"Copy code\" option when you receive a code or one-time password (OTP). It can also show you smart actions for calls, emails, maps and calendar events. Display Magic Cards with a short tap on any message marked with the \u2728 icon.\r\n\r\n<i>Pro Tip: You can also share Magic Cards! Just long press the card and choose if you want to send it to your current contact (drop on the right button) or to someone else (left button).</i>\r\n\r\n<b>Pin to Top</b>\r\nLong-press to pin your favorite chats on top of the list.\r\n\r\n<b>Mass Sending</b>\r\nBulk send any message with the multiple SMS option.\r\n\r\n<b>Schedule sending</b>\r\nDefine a date and time and automatically postpone sending a message.\r\n\r\n<b>Dark Mode</b>\r\nManually or automatically switch to dark mode at predefined hours.\r\n\r\n<b>Emoji Predictions</b>\r\nGet emoji suggestions related with the emotion in your message.\r\nDownload this option from \u201cSettings\u201d \u2013 it\u2019s free!\r\n\r\n<b>Wallpapers and Themes</b>\r\nPersonalize screens and chat bubbles with custom colors, and set cool wallpapers or any of your own pictures as background in your chats.\r\n\r\n<b>And more...</b>\r\nSpam box, contact blocking, notification privacy, scroll buttons, etc.\r\n\r\n<b>Completely Free</b>\r\nSmart Messages is forever free of charge and without subscription.\r\n\r\n<b>Your privacy is our top priority!</b>\r\nWe don\u2019t store any of your data on our servers. Check out our Privacy Policy for more details about our commitment to protect your privacy.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Smart Messages is the Best <b>SMS, MMS &amp; RCS (Chat)</b> replacement texting app for your phone, with the greatest advanced and rich chat features for a gorgeous and fast texting experience with your friends. And the best part? <u>It\u2019s all completely free</u>!<br><br><b>Rich Communication Features</b><br>Smart Messages packs a modern Delivery and Read Receipt feature for SMS/MMS that works just like in popular instant messaging apps but without creating an account. It also has a fast and accurate Typing Indicator that shows you when your friends are texting you.<br><br><i>Note: The delivery receipts work out of the box, however the read receipts and typing indicator require Internet access and that your contacts use Smart Messages too. Rich Communication Features are compatible with every phone number and all mobile carriers.</i><br><br>Smart Messages is the BEST alternative to your stock SMS, MMS and RCS (chat) texting app, and the 1st messaging app with a predictive AI engine that anticipates what you want so you don\u2019t have to search.<br><br>See, not all texting apps are the same. If you are looking for the best SMS app 2023 look no further. With Smart Messages you get a messenger with first-class user experience, saving you time and making your life easier.<br><br>Smart Messages has a great user interface based on the latest Material Design principles and offers the most complete set of features that you will love: read receipts and typing indicator (RCS features are only available to Smart Messages users), group chat, fast replies, emoji predictions based on intelligent emotion recognition in your text messages, easy sharing of videos, images, your geolocation\u2026 Texting with friends and family will never be the same!<br><br>Smart Messages is 100% FREE FOREVER (NO subscription, NO paid features), does not track you, and protects your privacy as well as your phone data!<br><br>Download now the best SMS app for Android and start a magical journey!<br><br><b>Spam Blocker</b><br>Mark any conversation as spam, and all similar messages will automagically go to spam next time you receive them.<br><br><b>Group Chat</b><br>Send and receive messages from multiple recipients, all in the same place. Please be aware that your carrier may limit this feature.<br><br><b>Dual SIM</b><br>Switch easily between two phone numbers.<br><br><b>Smart Notifications</b><br>Answer directly from notifications with a full-featured experience.<br><br><b>Fast Reply</b><br>Respond to messages even faster with smart suggestions.<br><br><b>Magic Cards</b><br>Smart Messages uses Artificial Intelligence (AI) to show you relevant actions when you need them, like a &quot;Copy code&quot; option when you receive a code or one-time password (OTP). It can also show you smart actions for calls, emails, maps and calendar events. Display Magic Cards with a short tap on any message marked with the \u2728 icon.<br><br><i>Pro Tip: You can also share Magic Cards! Just long press the card and choose if you want to send it to your current contact (drop on the right button) or to someone else (left button).</i><br><br><b>Pin to Top</b><br>Long-press to pin your favorite chats on top of the list.<br><br><b>Mass Sending</b><br>Bulk send any message with the multiple SMS option.<br><br><b>Schedule sending</b><br>Define a date and time and automatically postpone sending a message.<br><br><b>Dark Mode</b><br>Manually or automatically switch to dark mode at predefined hours.<br><br><b>Emoji Predictions</b><br>Get emoji suggestions related with the emotion in your message.<br>Download this option from \u201cSettings\u201d \u2013 it\u2019s free!<br><br><b>Wallpapers and Themes</b><br>Personalize screens and chat bubbles with custom colors, and set cool wallpapers or any of your own pictures as background in your chats.<br><br><b>And more...</b><br>Spam box, contact blocking, notification privacy, scroll buttons, etc.<br><br><b>Completely Free</b><br>Smart Messages is forever free of charge and without subscription.<br><br><b>Your privacy is our top priority!</b><br>We don\u2019t store any of your data on our servers. Check out our Privacy Policy for more details about our commitment to protect your privacy.",
